#ETH  Currently, the 1-hour level is still in a large range, and the EMA is also showing a bullish arrangement. If it breaks through here, we can expect the range to approach 3040; 
If we tentatively assume a head and shoulders bottoming pattern, a break above the neckline suggests a target of 3060. 
Short positions should be established at 3040-3060, with a stop loss at 3081 and a take profit near 2970; 
If there is a pullback to between 2930-2945, we can enter long based on the signal candlestick, aiming for a take profit above 3000 and a stop loss at 2914. 
The weekend is approaching, and with a lack of liquidity, any further upward movement may result in continued range-bound fluctuations.
